window.products.push({"id":880006,"name":"New Edition Japanese Feng Shui Lucky Maneki Neko Waving Paw Beckon Cat Battery Operated (Gold)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31JUmGSqMUL._AC_.jpg","description":"Fortune Cats, also known as Lucky Cats, Beckoning Cats, Money Cats or Maneki Neko in Japanese are believed to attract wealth and good fortune wherever it is displayed. For those who are highly professional, the Fortune Cat is said to help you climb the career ladder and attain an impressive salary. For those involved in competitive business, the Fortune Cats are believed to attract extra sales opportunities to you. Not only do they benefit in many ways, but the Fortune Cat is also adorable to look at and can be easily seen at the entrance in shops, restaurants, and other businesses in Asia, especially Japan. These cats are considered to bring luck into homes and businesses in Chinese and Japanese cultures because the paw is mechanical and can move. this is even more auspicious. The waving motion is said to bring a homes inhabitants wealth and prosperity.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31JUmGSqMUL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LuckyGifts","source_asin":"B078TMG72Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-880006","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078TMG72Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078TMG72Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":880007,"name":"GINKGO Taco Holder Stand up Set of 12, 4 Colorful Plastic Taco Shell Holder Plate Protector Food Holder, Microwave Safe Stands for Soft and Hard Shell","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XtuYN6rZL._AC_SL1154_.jpg","description":"INTIMATE DESIGN - The finished taco can be held by children or eaten on a plate? NO! It can be easily solved by using our taco holder. You can put the taco on the shelf to perfectly keep the filling intact, compared with a two or three grid taco holder, this holder can have very distinct independent characteristics, you can always pick up the taco with your hand and enjoy it alone. COLORFUL AND FUN - The colorful four colors can meet your needs. You can choose your favorite color to display the food, which will make you feel that the food is more delicious, and the color has been used to distinguish taco well during the party. Never worry about your Taco getting confused with others. PORTABLE AND SAVE SPACE - Stack the 12 holders together for easy storage, without taking up space or adding any weight to your trip or picnic basket. They look good on a plate or in the middle of a table, perfect for the outdoors and look great at a party.The small size allows you to put this taco holder on the plate while putting some other food. SAFE AND EASY TO CLEAN - Throw those beautifully loaded tacos in the microwave, right on these holders - they are microwave safe. They are also heat resistant so no worries about working with hot ingredients (just be safe!) and when you're done, throw them right in the dishwasher - they can take it! GINKGO DESIGN - We have designed Plastic shell for the taco holder, which can protect the product and be beautiful, you can give it as a gift to every friend who loves taco.Buy it NOW! If there is any issue that makes you feel unhappy about our product, we promise you a 100% money refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XtuYN6rZL._AC_SL1154_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ginkgo","source_asin":"B088JW1Z72","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-880007","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088JW1Z72","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088JW1Z72","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
