window.products.push({"id":880288,"name":"Lokass Reusable Silicone Food Storage Bags,Stand up Freezer Airtight Seal Food Preservation Containers Leakproof Versatile Preservation Bag for Sandwi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51IEv5HWJzL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"1.Food grade silicone rubber: Made of food grade silicone rubber (the same material as the teat), safe, environmentally friendly, non-toxic,Meets the standards for daily necessities for food contact (LFGB and FDA).Keep food fresh.Leak-proof and vacuum-tight design prevents liquid from flowing out when inverted.Ideal container for storing liquids, fruits, salads, breads, snacks, vegetables and meat etc 2.reusable:This silicone storage bag is soft, easy to fold, wear-resistant, easy to clean and can be used repeatedly.It has a service life of up to 10 years.It can be used to replace the disposable plastic bags and fragile large-capacity glass jars that you usually use.（The bags does have a chemical smell when I opened the bags. It is important to wash the bags before using them. wash them in a bit of dish detergent and salt water and let them air dry.） 3.Multifunction:It is both antifreeze and high temperature resistant, with a temperature range of -40°F to 392°F (-40°C to +200°C).It can be placed directly in the freezer, refrigerated or used in a tempering furnace for short periods of time (recommended within 10 minutes).You can put it in a skillet to heat the food, or use these bags to cook (sous vide), store, freeze and heat the food, which is also a good container for soup storage. It can also be washed directly into the dishwasher. 4.Perfect size: This silicone food storage bag is about 6 x 2.8x 7.2 inches; it can hold 1000ML liquid and 34 OZ food. The volumetric scale and translucent design of the surface make it easy to identify the food in the bag.The folding design makes it easy to open and close, keeps standing when filling, and the wide opening makes it easy to fill and clean.Sturdy, high quality silicone bag. It rolls up nicely for storage and is easy to remove excess air 5.Multi-purpose:This reusable silicone food storage bag can be used not only in your kitchen, but also outdoors or travel.Use it to carry the liquid in your baggage when traveling by air.Use it to carry the essential food fruit and drinks at the picnic.Its slim shape and convenient carrying style,Whether you are at home, office, picnic or on the tour, it can provide a safe, convenient, environmentally friendly and easy way to live your life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51IEv5HWJzL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LOKASS","source_asin":"B07S5R5MVM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-880288","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S5R5MVM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S5R5MVM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
