window.products.push({"id":880551,"name":"Guwet Wall Mirror for Bathroom,32x24 Mirror for Wall with Aluminium and Armoured Glass,Decorative Wall Mirrors for Living Room,Bedroom,Anti-Rust, Shat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.87,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xHIZuVKGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ღ【Practical and Decorative bathroom mirror】GUWET bathroom vanity mirror is made of high definition shatterproof glass and high grade aluminum alloy metal frame. The mirror frame has a rounded rectangular shape with a very modern style. Perfect for your room decor. Meet the decorative needs of industrial, rustic and modern style bathrooms, bedroom vanities, entryways, hotels or salons ღ【Aluminum alloy frame design】The aluminum alloy frame is brushed with straight grain process, which makes the edge of this bathroom mirror with metallic luster and texture. The anodizing process makes the metal frame waterproof and rust-proof. Durable and non-deforming shape with a life span of 50,000 hours (if you use it 3 hours a day, that means you can use it for 45 years) ღ【Shatterproof glass/silver plating】: This wonderful bathroom mirror is made of 5mm tempered glass, shatterproof, explosion-proof and safer to use. Shatterproof film is an important protective layer that will not splash into pieces when broken. Exquisite bathroom mirrors are always combined with multiple craft layers. The excellent silver plating layer provides high-definition reflection without any distortion on the wall-mounted mirror. ღ【Safe and easy to install】Our bathroom mirrors includes 4 metal hooks, no need to align the small holes like other mirrors, you can easily install the mirror, support horizontal and vertical installation. The bracket is strong enough to support the weight of the mirror, which can improve the stability and safety of the wall mirror. Also each mirror is fixed in a custom thick foam box to protect the mirror from being broken during transportation. ღ【Professional service team】 GUWET as a 24-year mirror manufacturer, we value our customers, 100% broken/damaged mirrors arrive with a replacement or money back guarantee, providing you with a 5-year warranty and hassle-free returns, promising customer service will solve your problem within 24 hours!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xHIZuVKGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Guwet","source_asin":"B0C6GVZ2KR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-880551","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6GVZ2KR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6GVZ2KR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
