window.products.push({"id":880602,"name":"Reyade Fabric Dresser for Bedroom, 8 Drawer Dresser, Chest of Drawers for Closet, Living Room, Nursery, Entryway, 4 Tier Storage Tower, Organizer Unit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81U440C91kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Practical & Versatile】Our chest of drawers is a perfect storage organizer, can be used as a storage cabinet, table, nightstand, TV stand. Ideal for bedrooms, living rooms, kitchens, office, closets, nurseries, kid's room, playrooms, entryway, hallway and more. Match perfectly with other Reyade fabric dressers. 【Large Storage Space】Product Dimension: 31.5\" x 11.8\" x 37\". The dresser for bedroom store all your clothes and accessories in one convenient place to keep things neat and under control. Wooden tabletop provides a hard surface for photo frames, lamps, clocks, books, glasses and other daily essentials. 【Stable Construction】With excellent functionality, simple and modern appearance, this drawer chest is made of high quality particle board and strong steel frame, sturdy, durable, lightweight, and also ensures long-term use. The whole structure will not wobble under full load. The drawer can bear up to 11 lbs. 【Convenient Design】8 drawers can be removed and folded; Wooden handles help opening and closing more easily; 4 plastic feet protect your floor from scratches and they are adjustable for uneven floors and carpats; Tough non-woven fabric drawers is breathable and harmless, suitable for children, teens and adults. 【Easy to Assemble】Package comes with all the tools needed and accessories, it is easy for you to assemble with detailed instructions. Any problems before or after your purchase please feel free to contact us, everyone in REYADE are always ready to offer you professional customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81U440C91kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Reyade","source_asin":"B08M94H13R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-880602","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08M94H13R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08M94H13R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":880603,"name":"QZINI Knife Sharpener 8207 - 3-Stage Precision Knife Sharpener – best in class - designer look – portable - fantastic kitchen aid – 12 month guarantee","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gqMTxy1xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"How to keep your knives consistently sharp and long-lasting or your money back Using dull knives slows down preparation and cooking time, and can be frustrating. The QZINI Knife Sharpener will help you avoid these problems. It is stylish, elegant, and ergonomically-designed by a team of experts with a profound knowledge of the science and art of knives and knife sharpening, it features notched wheels made of manganese carbon steel, which is particularly harder and stronger, and therefore, longer-lasting. The notches are angled, providing the right level of abrasion for your blade, and you have the added benefit of the freedom to control the angle during sharpening. There are three slots: the first is to restore or recreate a workable edge for really dull knives. Do take particular care so that you do not take off too much material. Use gentle, smooth action, because the blade edge is the most important part of your knife. The middle slot is for sharpening, straightening out the curled metal on the edge to give you a continuous razor edge, & the third slot is for honing, to maintain the sharp edge that will remove microscopic imperfections and make your knives last longer. This Precision Knife Sharpener is a must-have tool for your kitchen or for outdoors. It is lightweight, portable and easy to use making the knife sharpening process a breeze - whether you are right-handed or left-handed. Comes with a comprehensive set of instructions and manufacturer’s 12 month guarantee. This beauty is best in its class! When you start using the Qzini Knife Sharpener, you will see that it is the best decision you've made to maintain your knives in good condition and to safeguard their longevity. Click the ‘Add to Cart’ button now to put the Qzini Knife Sharpener to work for you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gqMTxy1xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"QZINI","source_asin":"B00JDWEU8O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-880603","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00JDWEU8O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00JDWEU8O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
