window.products.push({"id":880613,"name":"EKO EcoCasa II Space Saving Bathroom Trash Can Combo Set, (2) 6 Liter Stainless Steel Trash Bins","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":48.72,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516G08vgFnL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"This EcoCasa II Space Saving Vertical 6L Stainless Steel Step Trash Can 2-Pack Combo Set provides twice as much sanitary, hands-free household trash management. The vertical alignment allows the flexibility of having touchless trash disposal in almost any space in your home. The slimline profile is enhanced by the stainless lid for a streamlined appearance and the fingerprint resistant finish means it is easy to keep clean. The sturdy pedal mechanism operates smoothly and is designed to last for years of daily use. The soft close damper lid closes quietly when done, or flip the stay open lid lever for easy clean up or bag changes. There is a built in plastic bag fixer to prevent your trash bag from slipping down. Two pack includes two 6L (1.6 Gallon) trash cans. US based customer support team. Dimensions: 6.3\"W x 13.3\"D x 11.5\"H. Height with Lid Open: 26.77\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516G08vgFnL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EKO","source_asin":"B09DQVHYZ1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-880613","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DQVHYZ1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DQVHYZ1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":880614,"name":"ROYDOM Whistling Tea Kettle Stainless Steel Teapot, 2-Liter Rainbow Teakettle for Stovetop Induction Stove Top, Fast Boiling Heat Water Tea Pot Maker ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lz+Z9Ce4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why Choose ROYDOM Teapot? When you can take the kettle from the elegant packaging, you can see the high quality of the flamboyant kettle. This fashionable teapot can satisfy all your needs of hot drinks. The colorful modern style brings fashion to your elegant kitchen. The ROYDOM kettle is also the perfect choice for Christmas gift. Designed for Safety and Comfort The handle and lid of the teapot adopt ergonomic design with non-slip bake-lite to provide a comfortable feel and protects your hands from heat. Safe and Easy to Clean The large pot opening design is not only convenient for water injection, but also easy to clean. The internal surface adopts electrolytic technology which is easy to clean and avoid breed scale. Smooth effluent There are 10 holes of water outlet for filter out the magazine and avoid sputtering. Streamlined design of the spout to avoid burns caused by splashing when pouring water. Large capacity design 2 quarts is approximately equal to 5.5 cups of 350 ml water. Suitable for the whole family to enjoy delicious tea and coffee. Tips 1. Please make sure that the water level reaches the whistle water line. When the water is boiling, the kettle will whistle.2. Do not completely fill or fill less than 0.5L of water to avoid boiling or spilling.3. When boiling water, keep the handle up to avoid burns.4. Method of removing scale: Pour the food grade citric acid detergent into the boiling pot, soak it for 5-10 minutes, then clean the scale with a rag and water. Specification Material: Stainless steelSurface Finish: Mirror finishMeasurement: 7.68 x 7.48 x 5.9 in (L x W x H)Weight: 1.1 lbCapacity: 2 quarts After Sales Service You will get 30-day money-back guarantee for any reason. If you have any question, please contact us without hesitate. We are committed to providing you with the best shopping experience","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lz+Z9Ce4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ROYDOM","source_asin":"B07LF9MLL7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-880614","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07LF9MLL7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07LF9MLL7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
