window.products.push({"id":880687,"name":"Explore Land 20W x 39L x 0.75H inch Gray Kitchen Comfort Mat, Office Standing Desk Mat, Premium Anti Fatigue Mat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61u8My1gRIL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Why use anti fatigue mats? Studies have found that standing periods longer than 90 minutes on hard floor surfaces is very uncomfortable and causes physical fatigue. Leg muscles become totally static and constricted as they work overtime to keep that person in an upright position. Blood flow is greatly reduced causing pain and discomfort.  In this situation the employees' heart is forced to work harder to pump blood through these constricted areas and his body begins to run out of energy. However, if a person is allowed to stand on an anti-fatigue mat, his muscles will subtly contract and expand as they adjust to the flexibility of the mat. About Explore Land Anti Fatigue Mat/Comfort Mat Explore Land Anti Fatigue Mat/Comfort Mat are uniquely designed to effectively suspend the body's weight by reducing impact on the legs and back. In addition to improving circulation, reducing back stress, and decreasing fatigue, using the mat also improves balance. 1. Measures: 39L x 20W x 0.75H inch. Thicker than most of anti fatigue mats in the market. 2. The soft, embossing surface and buoyant core encourage very subtle movements and re-alignments. 3. Embossing surface ensure enough friction no matter wearing shoes, socks or barefoot. 4. Beveled edge design and no-curl edges reduce trip hazard, and the non-slip bottom keeps mat in place. 5. Solid, one-piece heavy duty construction and a high-density core that's guaranteed not to lose cushion support over time. 6. Enjoy the soft comfort mat and reduce pain in the kitchen, laundry, garage or workplace. 7. LIFETIME WARRANTY. No questions asked guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61u8My1gRIL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Explore Land","source_asin":"B01GE4D9US","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-880687","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GE4D9US","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01GE4D9US","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
