window.products.push({"id":880724,"name":"G.a HOMEFAVOR 7 Inch Round Perforated Pizza Paddle, Pizza Turning Peel Metal Pizza Peel with Silicone Grip for Homemade Pizza Oven Accessories","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5149Wm4FvvS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DURABLE ANODIZED ALUMINUM: Perforated pizza peel is made of high quality hard anodized aluminum that protects the surface from oxidation. Not only is it resistant to high temperatures, but also to wear and corrosion. Contact food safely. Great for both home and commercial use. PRACTICAL PIZZA TURNER: The pizza shovel features perforations that reduce friction and allow excess flour to fall off easily. Making the bottom of the pizza crispier and more delicious. With tapered edge, it is easy to slide under pizzas with precision every time when you are turning it. STABLE HEAD DESIGN: This pizza turning peel is equipped with a diameter: 7 inches of head and 15.8 inches of handle, easy to operate. The handle with riveted joints improves durability. INSULATED SILICONE HANDLE: The handle allows your hands away from hot resource when you are turning the pizzas in the oven. Equipped with a non-slip silicone grip, which resists heat delivered from the handle. The hook design gives you a easy storage. EASY TO CLEAN AND STORE: It is recommended to hand wash with warm soapy water. Rinse and dry after using. It is a good helper for making cakes, pizzas, delicate breads and pastries.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5149Wm4FvvS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"G.a HOMEFAVOR","source_asin":"B094VQNS6V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-880724","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094VQNS6V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094VQNS6V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":880725,"name":"Trustech Evaporative Air Cooler, 3-In-1 Bladeless Fan, Instant Cool & Humidify with 3 Wind Speeds, No Noise, 12H Timer, LED display, Suitable for Larg","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Tft43va0S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you distressed by the hot air that the traditional fan blows out, but heat your environment up again? Trustech evaporative air cooler can help you solve the problem properly. Trustech evaporative air cooler provides you the instant cooling without noise and dust. It would be the perfect companion in this hot summer. This 3-In-1 evaporative air cooler is equipped with the newest evaporative cooling technology, including fanning, cooling & humidification function. Once the water and ice cubes have been placed in the water tank, press the cooling button and you can enjoy the cool, humid air blowing from the cooler.  What's more, with 3-speed mode, Evaporative air cooler gives all the comfort you need – low, medium, or high speed. We care much about the convenience of our evaporative air cooler, so its 12-Hour timer feature and remote control amplify your freedom. Just a click to control your air cooler from 26 feet, making it possible that enjoy a gentle outdoor wind in your own living room while you are reading your favorite books or enjoying the recent series without having to get up from the couch. Energy conservation is also our concern. Compared with your costly AC, Trustech evaporative cooler has no compressor and does not use chemical refrigerants and it is more environmentally friendly and safe for your health. Thanks to the bladeless design, it is much safer to use in the household that has children or pets. What's more, it avoids blowing dust making it far more friendly and is quieter compared with the traditional fan. And no awkward safety grille or blades to clean. If you are looking for a bladeless cooling solution, this Trustech bladeless evaporative cooler will be an unavoidable choice.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Tft43va0S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TRUSTECH","source_asin":"B08TBPWT6L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-880725","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TBPWT6L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TBPWT6L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
