window.products.push({"id":880943,"name":"PYY Commercial Toaster 300 Slices/Hour Conveyor Restaurant Toaster for Bun Bagel Bread Heavy Duty Stainless Steel Conveyor Toaster","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":399.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cjALfz4VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Efficient Commercial Toasters 300Slices/h】-The commercial conveyor toaster is efficiently high-power fast baking. You can put the bread continuously then make 300 slices of toast in one hour. Great Conveyor toaster for any commercial use, restaurants or bakery Use, office, hotel, school, cafeteria, and breakfast of big family. 【Low Noise and Easy to Clean 】- Our commercial conveyor toaster is equipped with air vents for effective heat dissipation. And chain transmission design features a food-grade chain net, which can deliver the bread fast and smoothly. With a removable crumb tray, you can clean the conveyor toaster easily. 【Easy to Operate】- PYY countertop size conveyor toaster is made of heavy-duty stainless steel, which increases durability and ensures corrosion resistance. With the switch knob, you can control the speeds and heating mode. Adjusting the knob to set proper speeds and heating temperature helps you finish baking work fastly. 【Front/Back Output Modes】-Capable of dispensing bread from the front or rear of the conveyor toaster on the chute.You can switch at will to meet different needs. The compact design of the toaster for the restaurant is perfect to fit in a countertop in the kitchen. Four non-slip feet to keep the toaster much more stable. 【7 Speed Options-Wide Usage】-The professional commercial toasters have 7-speed options and the knobs control the heating, meeting your different baking demands by adjusting speeds to control the color of bread and mode select to heating diverse foods. Adjustable belt speed to control the color of bread, 7 bread colors to select. You can use the conveyor toaster for bread, bun, bagel, donuts, bread, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cjALfz4VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PYY","source_asin":"B0BV9CJFKY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-880943","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BV9CJFKY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BV9CJFKY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
